  "slug": "corrective-action-inspection-checklist-form",
  "title": "Corrective Action Inspection Checklist Form",
  "subtitle": "Route the root-cause and recurrence-prevention action, verify readiness, record requirement-level results, contain exceptions, authorize status, and preserve accountable closeout.",
  "description": "An operational corrective action inspection checklist form for controlling a systemic quality issue and affected process scope from assignment through evidence-based inspection, exception containment, disposition, handoff, and final verification.",
  "use_case": "Use when a corrective action coordinator must inspect a systemic quality issue and affected process scope against the source finding, requirement, evidence, and corrective action procedure and provide a traceable basis to verify sustained effectiveness and close the corrective action with evidence.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
